# Trivy vulnerability exception registry.
#
# Format: one CVE ID per line, with an inline reason, approver, and expiry date.
# Example:
# CVE-2026-0001 # reason: false positive in unused binary; approver: security; expires: 2026-08-10
#
# Rules:
# - Exceptions require security approval.
# - Exceptions expire within 90 days.
# - Prefer upgrading or removing the vulnerable component over adding an exception.
#
# Current accepted exceptions: none.